                <description>Effective number of samples in Y-block, maximum 2048 12bits. Must by multiple of 4 for (FIR, FIR.X, L2NOM, ACC, MAR,MAR.X. Must be 512 for ACORR. Must be multiple of 2 for other operations.</description>
                <lsb>0</lsb>
                <msb>11</msb>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>CFGMEMYSTRIDE</name>
                <description>Stride value, currently it is 2 bits.</description>
