                <name>CFGAUTOSLEEPEN</name>
                <description>When logic 1, The AXON will sleep if there is no commands to process for the duraction of the time specified by cfg_inactivity_timer. The axon will automatically wakeup if any registers are written. Register reads will leave the axon in sleep. When logic 0, AXON will not go into sleep mode.</description>
                <lsb>28</lsb>
